      "headline": {
        "en": "Fidelity closes second real estate debt fund at $451m",
        "zh": "富达以4.51亿美元完成第二只房地产债务基金募集"
      },
      "summary": {
        "en": "Fidelity Investments has closed its second real estate debt opportunities fund at $451m, more than double the committed capital of its predecessor. The fund drew backing from institutional investors, family offices, registered investment advisers and high-net-worth individuals, and invests in private real estate loans and, opportunistically, tradeable real estate debt securities. Bill Maclay and Matthew Torchia manage the fund.",
        "zh": "富达投资（Fidelity Investments）以4.51亿美元完成其第二只房地产债务机会基金的募集，超过前一只基金承诺资本的两倍。该基金获得机构投资者、家族办公室、注册投资顾问及高净值个人的资金支持，投资于私募房地产贷款，并机会性地投资于可交易的房地产债务证券。该基金由Bill Maclay和Matthew Torchia共同管理。"
      },
      "gps": [],
