    {
      "id": "969fffdc8995",
      "date": "2026-09-29",
      "published_at": "2026-09-29T11:28:01+00:00",
      "headline": {
        "en": "SEC issues \"critical reminder\" on private credit valuations",
        "zh": "SEC就私募信贷估值发出“关键提醒”"
      },
      "summary": {
        "en": "The SEC issued a \"critical reminder\" that the industry must maintain rigour in valuing private assets, particularly private credit, as the investor pool grows. The statement concerns existing requirements rather than new rules, but stresses how assets are valued and how valuations and risk characteristics are disclosed. Private credit investments in registered fund portfolios grew nearly 60 per cent, from $170bn in December 2020 to $270bn in December 2025, the SEC said.",
        "zh": "SEC发出“关键提醒”，称随着投资者群体扩大，行业必须对私募资产、尤其是私募信贷的估值保持严谨。该声明涉及现有要求而非新规，但强调资产如何估值以及估值和风险特征如何向投资者披露。SEC表示，注册基金组合持有的私募信贷投资增长了近60%，从2020年12月的1700亿美元增至2025年12月的2700亿美元。"
      },
      "gps": [],
