        "en": "New York Life Investment Management takes majority stake in Invictus Capital Partners",
        "zh": "New York Life Investment Management 收购 Invictus Capital Partners 多数股权"
      },
      "summary": {
        "en": "New York Life Investment Management has taken a majority stake in Invictus Capital Partners, a $20bn US single-family residential credit manager, adding its Verus Mortgage Capital sourcing and securitisation platform. The deal expands NYLIM's residential mortgage and asset-based finance capabilities within its $304bn private markets platform and gives New York Life's general account access to Invictus's residential mortgage assets. Invictus has acquired more than $48bn of residential loans over the past decade and completed over 90 US residential mortgage-backed securitisations.",
        "zh": "New York Life Investment Management 已收购 Invictus Capital Partners 的多数股权。Invictus Capital Partners 是一家规模200亿美元的美国单户住宅信贷管理公司，其贷款获取与运营平台 Verus Mortgage Capital 一并纳入交易。该交易扩大了 NYLIM 在其3040亿美元私募市场平台内的住宅抵押贷款和资产支持金融能力，并使 New York Life 的一般账户获得 Invictus 的住宅抵押贷款资产渠道。过去十年间，Invictus 已收购超过480亿美元的住宅贷款，并完成90多笔美国住宅抵押贷款支持证券化交易。"
      },
